# Design channel exports (designs/): the .dc.html pages are the code-ready
# design authority and ARE tracked. The heavy atlas/scene raster art shipped
# alongside them is binary documentation per docs/DOCUMENTATION_STORAGE_POLICY.md
# and is re-extracted from the channel zips instead of committed.
designs/**/*.png
designs/**/*.jpg
designs/**/*.mp4
designs/**/*.zip
